@page "/how-to-create-opensubtitles-apikey"
    
<div id="title">
    <h1>Subz</h1>
    <span class="subtitle">How to create an api key</span>
    <hr class="solid">
</div>

<div>
    <p>
        To create an OpenSubtitles API key, follow these steps:
        1. Go to the <a href="https://www.opensubtitles.org">OpenSubtitles website.</a><br/><br/>
        2. Click on "Sign Up" to create a new account or log in if you already have one. <br/><br/>
        3. Once logged in, navigate to the "API Consumers" section of your account settings. <br/><br/>
        4. Then click on "New Consumer" button. <br/>
        <img src="how-to-create-api-key.png" alt="Api key guide. A screenshot of OpenSubtitles config page."/>
        5. Give it a name, its not important. Then uncheck "Allow anonymous downloads" box. Then click save.
        <img src="how-to-create-api-key-2.png" alt="Api key guide. A screenshot of OpenSubtitles config page."/>
        6. Copy your api key, you are ready to use it on the <NavLink href="@PageNames.Index">addon configuration page!</NavLink>
        <img src="how-to-create-api-key-3.png" alt="Api key guide. A screenshot of OpenSubtitles config page."/>
    </p>
</div>
